r ON, Signal, Limiter\",\"rows\":[[\"Amplifier Power\",\"LF: 500 W RMS\"],[\"Amplifier Power\",\"HF: 100 W RMS\"],[\"Distortion\",\"&lt; 0.1% THD at rated power\"],[\"Amplifier Protection\",\"Thermal, Limiter, Short circuit\"]]},{\"title\":\"AC Power\",\"rows\":[[\"Nominal voltage\",\"100 / 240 ± 10%, 50/60 Hz with PFC 95\"],[\"Operating range\",\"115 Vac. / 230 Vac.\"]]},{\"title\":\"Physical\",\"rows\":[[\"Mounting\",\"Lockable 1-3/8\\\" (35 mm) stand mount\"],[\"Rigging Inserts\",\"3 points, accepts M8 threaded hardware\"],[\"Input Connector\",\"1 XLR and 1/4\\\" TRS balanced\"],[\"Output Connector\",\"1 XLR balanced\"],[\"Net Weight\",\"21,4 kg (47.17 lb)\"],[\"Dimensions W/ H/ D\",\"69 cm x 40 cm x 45 cm (27.16\\\" x 15.74\\\" x 17.71\\\")\"]]}]',1,0,'performance',5,'2018-08-10 15:25:27','2026-10-21 22:57:03'),(99,1,'fp12','FP12','Compact self-powered full range speaker - 12\"','<p>The FROG-IS FP12 is the first choice for demanding musicians and DJs who work in loud environments.</p>\n<p>A multi-purpose speaker system, fully equipped to serve as a main PA, a stage monitor,<br>a distributed audio system and also other applications.</p>\n<p>The FP12 delivers punchy, assertive sound.<br>Its integrated dual channel Class D amplifier (400 Watts) provides high performance<br>and very high sound pressure levels with an exceedingly dynamic, tight and clean response.</p>\n<p>Loaded with high quality speakers, it provides premium audio performance with maximum reliability and minimum power compression that is easy to install.</p>\n<p>A strong-built and robust construction designed to handle high loads, rendering lead vocals, guitars, electronic instruments, and playback tracks with power and authority, easily delivering sound across medium-to-longer distances.</p>\n<p>The FP12 features provide musicians<br>and audiences with an excellent acoustic experience, even on the most demanding stages.</p>','[\"uploads/products/2026/10/fp12-1-396e62.jpg\",\"uploads/products/2026/10/fp12-2-032482.jpg\",\"uploads/2018/08/FP8_4.jpg\",\"uploads/2018/08/FP12back.jpg\"]','[{\"label\":\"Data sheet\",\"file\":\"uploads/2018/08/FP12.pdf\"},{\"label\":\"Manual\",\"file\":\"uploads/2018/08/FP12-manual-1.pdf\"}]','[\"High-power 2-way PA sound reinforcement speaker system for live and playback applications\",\"Compact and light weight system delivers excellent sound even at extreme sound pressure levels\",\"Extremely Efficient 12’’ woofer driver provides incredibly deep bass and acoustic power\",\"Precise 1’’ compression driver for exceptional high- frequency reproduction\",\"Ultra-wide dispersion\",\"Overload-protection circuitry ensures optimal HF driver protection\",\"Versatile trapezoidal enclosure design allows different positioning\",\"Stand mounting with 35-mm pole socket\",\"Tilts on its side for use as a floor monitor\",\"Rugged ABS box provides strength and manageability\",\"Ergonomically shaped handles for easy carrying and setup\",\"Designed, engineered and tuned in Italy\"]','[\"The FP12 is ideal for mobile and installed applications.<br>It is an excellent choice for a wide variety of applications, including retail stores, restaurants, health clubs, theme parks, educational facilities, hospitality, music cafes, leisure venues, and anywhere where a top quality high- output indoor/ outdoor foreground/ background music (and/or paging) speaker is required.\"]','[{\"title\":\"Acoustics\",\"rows\":[[\"Frequency range\",\"50 Hz - 20 kHz (± 3 dB)\"],[\"SPL 1W/1mt\",\"99 dB\"],[\"Maximum SPL\",\"125 dB @ 1 m peak\"]]},{\"title\":\"Coverage\",\"rows\":[[\"Horizontal\",\"90°\"],[\"Vertical\",\"70°\"]]},{\"title\":\"Transducers\",\"rows\":[[\"Low Frequency\",\"12\\\" woofer\"],[\"High Frequency\",\"1\\\" compression driver, horn loaded\"]]},{\"title\":\"Preamp and Processors\",\"rows\":[[\"Input Sensitivity\",\"Mic In: 8 mV\"],[\"Input Sensitivity\",\"Line In: 125 mV\"],[\"Input Impedance\",\"Mic In: 650 Ω unbalanced - 1.3 kΩ balanced\"],[\"Input Impedance\",\"Line In: 10 kΩ unbalanced - 19 kΩ balanced\"],[\"Crossover\",\"Frequency: 2.3 kHz Slope: 24 dB/octave\"],[\"Speaker Protection\",\"Thermal, Over-excursion\"],[\"Music Equalization\",\"+3 dB @ 75 Hz\"],[\"Music Equalization\",\"+3 dB @ 11 kHz\"],[\"Music Equalization\",\"Power ON, Signal, Limiter\"]]},{\"title\":\"Amplifiers\",\"rows\":[[\"Amplifier Power\",\"LF: 350 W RMS\"],[\"Amplifier Power\",\"HF: 50 W RMS\"],[\"Distortion\",\"&lt; 0.1% THD at rated power\"],[\"Amplifier Protection\",\"Thermal, Limiter, Short circuit\"]]},{\"title\":\"AC Power\",\"rows\":[[\"Nominal voltage\",\"100 / 240 ± 10%, 50/60 Hz with PFC 95\"],[\"Operating range\",\"125 Vac. / 195 – 250 Vac.\"]]},{\"title\":\"Physical\",\"rows\":[[\"Mounting\",\"Lockable 1-3/8\\\" (35 mm) stand mount\"],[\"Rigging Inserts\",\"3 points, accepts M8 threaded hardware\"],[\"Input Connector\",\"1 XLR and 1/4\\\" TRS balanced\"],[\"Output Connector\",\"1 XLR balanced\"],[\"Net Weight\",\"15 kg (33.07 lb)\"],[\"Dimensions W/ H/ D\",\"40 cm x 60 cm x 35 cm (15.75\\\" x 23.62\\\" x 13.78\\\")\"]]}]',1,0,'performance',4,'2018-08-10 15:14:29','2026-10-21 22:57:03'),(100,1,'fp8','FP8','Mini self-powered and full range speaker - 8\"','<p>The FROG-IS FP8 is the first choice for demanding musicians and DJs who work in loud environments.</p>\n<p>A multi-purpose speaker system, fully equipped to serve as a main PA, a stage monitor,<br>a distributed audio system and also other applications.</p>\n<p>The FP8 delivers punchy, assertive sound. Its integrated dual channel Class D amplifier (200 Watts) provides high performance and very high sound pressure levels with an exceedingly dynamic, tight and clean response.</p>\n<p>Loaded with top quality speakers, it provides premium audio performance with maximum reliability and minimum power compression that is easy to install.</p>\n<p>A strong-built and robust construction designed to handle high loads, rendering lead vocals, guitars, electronic instruments, and playback tracks with power and authority, easily delivering sound across medium-to-longer distances.</p>\n<p>The FP8 features provide musicians and audiences with an excellent acoustic experience, even on the most demanding stages.</p>','[\"uploads/products/2026/10/fp8-1-21e1d2.jpg\",\"uploads/products/2026/10/fp8-2-3c993a.jpg\",\"uploads/2018/08/FP8ar.jpg\",\"uploads/2018/08/FP8_4.jpg\",\"uploads/2018/08/FP8_5.jpg\"]','[{\"label\":\"Data sheet\",\"file\":\"uploads/2018/08/FP8.pdf\"},{\"label\":\"Manual\",\"file\":\"uploads/2018/08/FP8-manual.pdf\"}]','[\"High-power 2-way PA sound reinforcement speaker system for live and playback applications\",\"Ultra-compact and light weight system delivers excellent sound even at extreme sound pressure levels\",\"Extremely Efficient 8’’ woofer driver provides incredibly deep bass and acoustic power\",\"Precise 1’’ compression driver for exceptional high- frequency reproduction\",\"Ultra-wide dispersion\",\"Overload-protection circuitry ensures optimal HF driver protection\",\"Versatile trapezoidal enclosure design allows different positioning\",\"Stand mounting with 35-mm pole socket\",\"Tilts on its side for use as a floor monitor\",\"Rugged ABS box provides strength and manageability\",\"Ergonomically shaped handles for easy carrying and setup\",\"Designed, engineered and tuned in Italy\"]','[\"The FP8 is ideal for mobile and installed applications.<br>It is an excellent choice for a wide variety of applications, including retail stores, restaurants, health clubs, theme parks, educational facilities, hospitality, music cafes, leisure venues, and anywhere where a top quality high- output indoor/ outdoor foreground/ background music (and/or paging) speaker is required.\"]','[{\"title\":\"Acoustics\",\"rows\":[[\"Frequency range\",\"65 Hz - 20 kHz (± 3 dB)\"],[\"SPL 1W/1mt\",\"97 dB\"],[\"Maximum SPL\",\"120 dB @ 1 m peak\"]]},{\"title\":\"Coverage\",\"rows\":[[\"Horizontal\",\"90°\"],[\"Vertical\",\"70°\"]]},{\"title\":\"Transducers\",\"rows\":[[\"Low Frequency\",\"8\\\" woofer\"],[\"High Frequency\",\"1\\\" compression driver, horn loaded\"]]},{\"title\":\"Preamp and Processors\",\"rows\":[[\"Input Sensitivity\",\"Mic In: 8 mV\"],[\"Input Sensitivity\",\"Line In: 125 mV\"],[\"Input Impedance\",\"Mic In: 650 Ω unbalanced - 1.3 kΩ balanced\"],[\"Input Impedance\",\"Line In: 10 kΩ unbalanced - 19 kΩ balanced\"],[\"Crossover\",\"Frequency: 2.6 kHz Slope: 24 dB/octave\"],[\"Speaker Protection\",\"Thermal, Over-excursion\"],[\"Music Equalization\",\"+3 dB @ 75 Hz\"],[\"Music Equalization\",\"+3 dB @ 11 kHz\"],[\"Music Equalization\",\"Power ON, Signal, Limiter\"]]},{\"title\":\"Amplifiers\",\"rows\":[[\"Amplifier Power\",\"LF: 150 W RMS\"],[\"Amplifier Power\",\"HF: 50 W RMS\"],[\"Distortion\",\"&lt; 0.1% THD at rated power\"],[\"Amplifier Protection\",\"Thermal, Limiter, Short circuit\"]]},{\"title\":\"AC Power\",\"rows\":[[\"Nominal voltage\",\"100 / 240 ± 10%, 50/60 Hz with PFC 95\"],[\"Operating range\",\"125 Vac. / 195 – 250 Vac. (Selectable)\"]]},{\"title\":\"Physical\",\"rows\":[[\"Mounting\",\"Lockable 1-3/8\\\" (35 mm) stand mount\"],[\"Rigging Inserts\",\"3 points, accepts M8 threaded hardware\"],[\"Input Connector\",\"1 XLR and 1/4\\\" TRS balanced\"],[\"Output Connector\",\"1 XLR balanced\"],[\"Net Weight\",\"7.8 kg (17.20 lbs.)\"],[\"Dimensions W/ H/ D\",\"27 cm x 41 cm x 27 cm (10.63\\\" x 16.14\\\" x 10.63\\\")\"]]}]',1,0,'performance',3,'2018-08-10 14:41:51','2026-10-21 22:57:03'),(101,1,'fi-cc4','FI-CC4','4 inch High Performance Full Range Speaker','<p>FI-CC4 is a compact, high-performance full-range speaker built around a 4-inch neodymium driver. Its variable impedance (4 to 16 ohms) makes it easy to match to different amplifiers and installations, and the cabinet design reduces rear emission for better sound control and efficiency.</p><p>The stainless steel enclosure (IP64) stands up to tough conditions, so the FI-CC4 suits fixed installations in hospitality, entertainment, theatres, broadcast, houses of worship and residential spaces.</p>','[\"uploads/products/2026/10/fi-cc4-1-299620.jpg\",\"uploads/products/2026/10/fi-cc4-2-b0e97b.jpg\"]','[]','[\"4 inch full-range driver with neodymium magnet\",\"Variable impedance: 4 ohm to 16 ohm, selectable\",\"Cabinet design reduces rear emission for better control and efficiency\",\"Stainless steel enclosure, IP64\",\"Wide 90° x 90° coverage\",\"Very compact: 112 x 112 x 95 mm, only 1.2 kg\"]','[\"Hospitality, entertainment, theatres, broadcast, houses of worship and residential spaces\"]','[{\"title\":\"\",\"rows\":[[\"Type\",\"Passive loudspeaker\"],[\"Transducer\",\"4\\\" neodymium magnet full range driver\"],[\"Frequency Response\",\"150 Hz - 20 kHz (-6 dB), with dedicated preset\"],[\"Maximum SPL\",\"122 dB (peak)\"],[\"Power Handling\",\"140 W\"],[\"Coverage\",\"V.90° x H.90°\"],[\"Connector\",\"1x Phoenix connector (4-pin Euroblock)\"],[\"Nominal Impedance\",\"4 Ω - 16 Ω selectable\"],[\"IP Rating\",\"IP64\"],[\"Dimensions (W x H x D)\",\"112 x 112 x 95 mm (4.4 x 4.4 x 3.7 in)\"],[\"Weight\",\"1.2 kg (2.65 lb)\"],[\"Material\",\"Stainless steel\"],[\"Color\",\"Black\"]]}]',1,1,'performance',18,'2026-10-21 22:57:03','2026-10-21 22:57:03'),(102,1,'fi-cc8','FI-CC8','8 inch High Performance Full Range Speaker','<p>The FI-CC8 is a compact, reliable and high-performance passive loudspeaker designed to give clear and powerful sound in a wide range of applications. With an 8-inch ferrite magnet full-range dual-cone transducer, it delivers natural voice and music reinforcement with extended frequency response and high output levels.</p><p>It is built in a durable stainless steel enclosure and offers versatile connectivity: a Phoenix connector (4-pin Euroblock with speaker relaunch) and dual SpeakON NL4 connectors. The 16 ohm nominal impedance allows several units to be connected in parallel from a single amplifier channel.</p>','[\"uploads/products/2026/10/fi-cc8-1-412e1b.jpg\",\"uploads/products/2026/10/fi-cc8-2-59bc9c.jpg\"]','[]','[\"8 inch ferrite magnet full-range dual-cone transducer\",\"300 W power handling and up to 129 dB peak SPL\",\"Natural voice and music reinforcement with extended frequency response\",\"Stainless steel enclosure, IP64\",\"Phoenix connector and dual SpeakON NL4 for easy system integration\",\"16 ohm impedance: several units can share one amplifier channel\"]','[\"Live sound, outdoor installations, hospitality and entertainment venues, fixed and portable professional sound systems\"]','[{\"title\":\"\",\"rows\":[[\"Type\",\"Passive loudspeaker\"],[\"Transducer\",\"8\\\" ferrite magnet full-range dual cone transducer\"],[\"Frequency Response\",\"120 Hz - 18 kHz (-6 dB), with dedicated preset\"],[\"Maximum SPL\",\"129 dB (peak)\"],[\"Power Handling\",\"300 W\"],[\"Coverage\",\"V.90° x H.90°\"],[\"Connectors\",\"1x Phoenix connector (4-pin Euroblock) with speaker relaunch<br>2x SpeakON NL4 (1+ 1- signal, 2+ 2- through)\"],[\"Nominal Impedance\",\"16 Ω\"],[\"IP Rating\",\"IP64\"],[\"Dimensions (W x H x D)\",\"220 x 220 x 161 mm (8.7 x 8.7 x 6.3 in)\"],[\"Weight\",\"5.8 kg (14.3 lb)\"],[\"Material\",\"Stainless steel\"],[\"Color\",\"Black\"]]}]',1,1,'performance',19,'2026-10-21 22:57:03','2026-10-21 22:57:03'),(103,1,'fi-cc10','FI-CC10','10 inch High Performance Coaxial Speaker','<p>The FI-CC10 sits between the 8 and 12 inch models of the range. A 10-inch ferrite magnet woofer with a 1-inch compression driver on the same axis gives a compact, high-output point source with controlled coverage.</p><p>The rugged stainless steel cabinet, Phoenix and dual SpeakON NL4 connectors and 16 ohm impedance make it equally at home in fixed installations and in portable professional sound systems.</p>','[\"uploads/products/2026/10/fi-cc10-1-afcb8c.jpg\",\"uploads/products/2026/10/fi-cc10-2-8a278b.jpg\"]','[]','[\"10 inch ferrite magnet woofer with 1 inch compression driver (coaxial)\",\"350 W power handling and up to 129 dB peak SPL\",\"Stainless steel enclosure, IP54\",\"Phoenix connector and dual SpeakON NL4 for easy system integration\",\"16 ohm impedance: several units can share one amplifier channel\"]','[\"Live sound, concerts and events, clubs, auditoriums, fixed installations and portable professional sound systems\"]','[{\"title\":\"\",\"rows\":[[\"Type\",\"Passive loudspeaker\"],[\"Transducer\",\"10\\\" ferrite magnet woofer with 1\\\" compression driver (coaxial)\"],[\"Frequency Response\",\"120 Hz - 20 kHz (-6 dB), with dedicated preset\"],[\"Maximum SPL\",\"129 dB (peak)\"],[\"Power Handling\",\"350 W\"],[\"Coverage\",\"V.60° x H.90°\"],[\"Connectors\",\"1x Phoenix connector (4-pin Euroblock)<br>2x SpeakON NL4 (1+ 1- signal, 2+ 2- through)\"],[\"Nominal Impedance\",\"16 Ω\"],[\"IP Rating\",\"IP54\"],[\"Dimensions (W x H x D)\",\"272 x 277 x 180 mm (10.7 x 10.9 x 7.1 in)\"],[\"Weight\",\"9.2 kg (20.3 lb)\"],[\"Material\",\"Stainless steel\"],[\"Color\",\"Black\"]]}]',1,1,'performance',20,'2026-10-21 22:57:03','2026-10-21 22:57:03'),(104,1,'fi-cc12','FI-CC12','12 inch Coaxial High Performance Speaker','<p>The FI-CC12 is a passive loudspeaker with a 12-inch coaxial transducer in a compact metal frame. It is designed for outdoor and indoor applications, both rental and permanent, and suits large auditoriums, stadiums, theme parks, clubs and touring.</p><p>Its weather-resistant, rugged metal box combines high performance with a small size and weight, and is quick and easy to set up.</p>','[\"uploads/products/2026/10/fi-cc12-1-a88a9e.jpg\",\"uploads/products/2026/10/fi-cc12-2-3931a3.jpg\"]','[]','[\"12 inch ferrite magnet woofer with 1 inch compression driver (coaxial)\",\"400 W power handling and up to 129 dB peak SPL\",\"Narrow vertical coverage (30°) for long throw and array use\",\"Weather-resistant rugged stainless steel box, IP54\",\"High performance for its size and weight, fast and easy setup\",\"SpeakON NL4 input and link connectors\"]','[\"Large auditoriums, stadiums, theme parks, clubbing, touring, concerts and corporate events, houses of worship\"]','[{\"title\":\"\",\"rows\":[[\"Type\",\"Passive loudspeaker\"],[\"Transducer\",\"12\\\" ferrite magnet woofer with 1\\\" compression driver (coaxial)\"],[\"Frequency Response\",\"125 Hz - 20 kHz (-6 dB), with dedicated preset\"],[\"Maximum SPL\",\"129 dB (peak)\"],[\"Power Handling\",\"400 W\"],[\"Coverage\",\"V.30° x H.90°\"],[\"Connectors\",\"SpeakON NL4 (1+ 1- signal, 2+ 2- link)\"],[\"Nominal Impedance\",\"32 Ω\"],[\"IP Rating\",\"IP54\"],[\"Dimensions (W x H x D)\",\"327 x 334 x 198 mm (12.9 x 13.15 x 7.8 in)\"],[\"Weight\",\"13.8 kg (30.43 lb)\"],[\"Material\",\"Stainless steel\"],[\"Color\",\"Black\"]]}]',1,1,'performance',21,'2026-10-21 22:57:03','2026-10-21 22:57:03'),(105,5,'fi-sub210','FI-SUB210','2x10 inch Stainless Steel Passive Subwoofer','<p>The FI-SUB210 is a compact powerhouse: a 10-inch ferrite magnet woofer and a 10-inch passive radiator deliver a precise bass response with high power and efficiency.</p><p>The cabinet and the grille are made entirely of steel, a robust and durable design well suited to outdoor installations (IP64 with a sealing cap). With a frequency response from 40 Hz to 250 Hz it gives deep definition in the bass range. A passive low-pass filter is built in, so it can be driven without a dedicated preset for quick and easy installations. Movable rubber feet allow vertical, horizontal or up-firing placement, which makes it versatile from hospitality and corporate settings to residential use.</p>','[\"uploads/products/2026/10/fi-sub210-1-5809e8.jpg\",\"uploads/products/2026/10/fi-sub210-2-a09e7c.jpg\"]','[]','[\"10 inch ferrite magnet woofer plus 10 inch passive radiator\",\"Frequency response 40 Hz - 250 Hz\",\"Built-in passive low-pass filter: no dedicated preset needed\",\"Cabinet and grille entirely in stainless steel\",\"Suited to outdoor installations (IP64 with sealing cap)\",\"Movable rubber feet for vertical, horizontal or up-firing placement\"]','[\"Hospitality, corporate and residential installations, indoor and outdoor, wherever a compact and powerful sub is needed\"]','[{\"title\":\"\",\"rows\":[[\"Type\",\"Passive subwoofer\"],[\"Transducer\",\"10\\\" ferrite magnet woofer + 10\\\" passive radiator\"],[\"Frequency Response\",\"40 Hz - 150 Hz (-6 dB), with dedicated preset<br>40 Hz - 250 Hz, with the built-in passive low-pass filter (no preset)\"],[\"Maximum SPL\",\"124 dB (peak)\"],[\"Rated Power\",\"400 W (peak)\"],[\"Coverage\",\"Omni\"],[\"Connector\",\"1x Phoenix connector (4-pin Euroblock)\"],[\"Nominal Impedance\",\"4 Ω\"],[\"IP Rating\",\"IP64 (with sealing cap)\"],[\"Dimensions (W x H x D)\",\"560 x 282 x 150 mm (22.0 x 11.1 x 5.9 in)\"],[\"Weight\",\"13 kg (28.7 lb)\"],[\"Material\",\"Stainless steel\"],[\"Color\",\"Black\"]]}]',1,1,'performance',903,'2026-10-21 22:57:03','2026-10-21 22:57:03'),(106,5,'fi-sub215','FI-SUB215','2x15 inch Stainless Steel Passive Subwoofer','<p>The FI-SUB215 brings the same design to a larger size: a 15-inch ferrite magnet woofer and a 15-inch passive radiator for deeper bass and higher output, in a cabinet and grille made entirely of steel.</p><p>A built-in passive low-pass filter lets it be driven without a dedicated preset, and movable rubber feet allow standing, down-firing or up-firing placement. It is a versatile partner for the FI-CC series in larger venues, events and outdoor installations (IP64 with a sealing cap).</p>','[\"uploads/products/2026/10/fi-sub215-1-d8f753.jpg\",\"uploads/products/2026/10/fi-sub215-2-9b12a9.jpg\"]','[]','[\"15 inch ferrite magnet woofer plus 15 inch passive radiator\",\"Deep bass: frequency response down to 32 Hz\",\"Built-in passive low-pass filter: no dedicated preset needed\",\"Cabinet and grille entirely in stainless steel\",\"Suited to outdoor installations (IP64 with sealing cap)\",\"Natural partner of the FI-CC series\"]','[\"Larger venues, clubs, events and outdoor installations that need deep, powerful low frequencies\"]','[{\"title\":\"\",\"rows\":[[\"Type\",\"Passive subwoofer\"],[\"Transducer\",\"15\\\" ferrite magnet woofer + 15\\\" passive radiator\"],[\"Frequency Response\",\"32 Hz - 150 Hz (-6 dB), with dedicated preset<br>32 Hz - 250 Hz, with the built-in passive low-pass filter (no preset)\"],[\"Maximum SPL\",\"128 dB (peak)\"],[\"Rated Power\",\"800 W (peak)\"],[\"Coverage\",\"Omni\"],[\"Connector\",\"1x Phoenix connector (4-pin Euroblock)\"],[\"Nominal Impedance\",\"4 Ω\"],[\"IP Rating\",\"IP64 (with sealing cap)\"],[\"Dimensions (W x H x D)\",\"840 x 420 x 230 mm (33.1 x 16.5 x 9.1 in)\"],[\"Weight\",\"38 kg (83.8 lb)\"],[\"Material\",\"Stainless steel\"],[\"Color\",\"Black\"]]}]',1,1,'performance',904,'2026-10-21 22:57:03','2026-10-21 22:57:03');
